(7104837, 1082715, 124982, '<td valign="top">Quite lovely. First image of the challenge that has moved me to comment. Love the contrast in black and white and the spirals and squares. Simply lovely!</td>', 'Quite lovely. First image of the challenge that has moved me to comment. Love the contrast in black and white and the spirals and squares. Simply lovely!', '2013-09-19 22:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7104838, 1082803, 124982, '<td valign="top">A lot of potential. I would''ve like to have seen a much tighter crop to bring the focus to the pinwheel a lot more intimately, and also seen the exposure upped since it appears underexposed and in danger of disappearing into the background.</td>', 'A lot of potential. I would''ve like to have seen a much tighter crop to bring the focus to the pinwheel a lot more intimately, and also seen the exposure upped since it appears underexposed and in danger of disappearing into the background.', '2013-09-19 22:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
